+|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| $WorkItemId | $Kind | $ExternalId | $Authority | $AuthorityRevision | $approval | $ParentSelector | $Acceptance | $TraceIds | $Mode | $DesignRevision | $ParentWorkItemId | $DecisionReference |
